# Route: guide 43 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to 59, 44
# quests, 3.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Tanaris, Duskwood, Searing Gorge, Dustwallow Marsh, The Barrens,
# Feralas): Gadgetzan -> Broken Pillar -> Gadgetzan -> Darkshire -> Raven Hill
# -> Firewatch Ridge -> Dustfire Valley -> Grimesilt Dig Site -> Theramore
# Isle -> The Quagmire -> The Merchant Coast -> Theramore Isle -> Brackenwall
# Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric
# the Black 52, Obsidion 52); Shadowshard Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler
# 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38).
